  "description": "The native payload for Agora's virtual background extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_iOS 4.6.2 archive and packaged for .NET for iOS. Segments the person from the scene so the background can be blurred, replaced with an image or filled with a colour. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.iOS or Net.Agora.Voice.iOS — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraRtcEngineKit.EnableVirtualBackground in the RTC binding.",
